{"name":"Dark Chocolate","hex":"#624a49","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"dark chocolate","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Chocolate that has not had milk products added to lighten and sweeten it.","A serving or a variety of this chocolate."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/dark_chocolate"}],"entries":[{"title":"Dark chocolate","blocks":[{"text":"Dark chocolate, also known as plain chocolate and black chocolate, is a form of chocolate made from chocolate liquor, cocoa butter and sugar. It has a higher cocoa percentage than white chocolate and milk chocolate. Dark chocolate is valued for its health benefits, and for its reputation as a sophisticated choice of chocolate. Like milk and white chocolate, dark chocolate is used to make chocolate bars and to coat confectionery."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cd/Green_and_Black%27s_dark_chocolate_bar_2.jpg/330px-Green_and_Black%27s_dark_chocolate_bar_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dark_chocolate"},{"title":"Dark Chocolate (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Dark Chocolate is a 2016 Indian Bengali crime thriller film directed by Agnidev Chatterjee and made under Macneill Engineering studio."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/e1/Dark_Chocolate.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dark_Chocolate_(film)"},{"title":"Chocolate","blocks":[{"text":"Chocolate is a food made from roasted and ground cocoa beans. It can be a liquid, solid, or paste. It is eaten on its own and used to flavor other foods."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/11/Three_Bars_%281%29.jpg/330px-Three_Bars_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chocolate"},{"title":"Darkness","blocks":[{"text":"D